WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.614 --> 00:00:04.544
Most fans are here to enjoy the match.

2
00:00:04.790 --> 00:00:10.194
In this lesson: why conflict happens, how to spot it growing,

3
00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:15.353
how to stay safe, and the words that calm it.

4
00:00:15.598 --> 00:00:20.511
Your line is simple: observe, calm with words, report, escalate.

5
00:00:20.757 --> 00:00:22.722
You never touch anyone.

6
00:00:22.967 --> 00:00:24.687
Ever.
